    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight mb-4 font-[family-name:'Space_Grotesk']">About Toolix</h1>
    <p class="text-xl text-[var(--color-text-secondary)] mb-8">Free online tools built with zero uploads, zero accounts, and absolute privacy.</p>

    <section class="mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">Mission</h2>
      <p class="text-[var(--color-text-secondary)] leading-relaxed mb-4">Toolix exists to provide high-quality online utilities without compromising privacy or imposing barriers. Every tool runs directly in the user's browser using WebAssembly and Web Workers — no cloud infrastructure, no tracking cookies, no data collection.</p>
      <p class="text-[var(--color-text-secondary)] leading-relaxed">Our zero-compute architecture means running the site for 50,000 visitors costs the same as running it for 5: a flat static hosting tier.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">Editorial Standards</h2>
      <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 text-[var(--color-text-secondary)]">
        <li>Every tool page includes 800–1,200 words of technical guidance.</li>
        <li>All claims are verified with documented sources (dictionary sources, mathematical formulas, conversion standards).</li>
        <li>Privacy guarantees are explicit and verified through client-side architecture (Web Workers, CSP headers, no external fonts or trackers).</li>
        <li>Design follows Impeccable anti-pattern rules: no purple gradients, no pure black/white, restrained layout.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">Contact</h2>
      <p class="text-[var(--color-text-secondary)]">For partnership, editorial, or technical inquiries, reach out through the <a href="/contact" class="text-[var(--color-accent)] hover:underline">contact page</a>.</p>
    </section>
  </main>
